  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mental and mystical synergy allows you cast spells without thought.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Reflexive Spell<sup>WK</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you cast a reflexive spell in place of making an attack of opportunity, you add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) as a bonus on your attack roll and any caster level checks, or concentration checks associated with the reflexive spell.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-ki-feats#toc65\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
